  "AI Assistant Terms & Important Information": "Ketentuan & Informasi Penting Asisten AI",
  "Before using the AI Assistant, please review the following important information:": "Sebelum menggunakan Asisten AI, harap tinjau informasi penting berikut:",
  "Usage Costs": "Biaya Penggunaan",
  "Using AI providers may incur charges based on your usage. These costs are billed directly by the AI provider (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) and are not covered by Headlamp.": "Penggunaan penyedia AI dapat menimbulkan biaya berdasarkan penggunaan Anda. Biaya ini ditagih langsung oleh penyedia AI (OpenAI, Anthropic, dll.) dan tidak ditanggung oleh Headlamp.",
  "API Keys": "Kunci API",
  "You will need to provide your own API keys from AI providers. These keys are stored locally in your browser and are not transmitted to Headlamp servers.": "Anda perlu menyediakan kunci API Anda sendiri dari penyedia AI. Kunci-kunci ini disimpan secara lokal di browser Anda dan tidak dikirimkan ke server Headlamp.",
  "Data Privacy": "Privasi Data",
  "Your queries and cluster information will be sent to the selected AI provider for processing. Please review your AI provider's privacy policy and ensure you comply with your organization's data policies.": "Permintaan dan informasi kluster Anda akan dikirim ke penyedia AI yang dipilih untuk diproses. Silakan tinjau kebijakan privasi penyedia AI Anda dan pastikan Anda mematuhi kebijakan data organisasi Anda.",
  "Responsibility": "Tanggung Jawab",
  "You are responsible for monitoring your usage, managing costs, and ensuring compliance with your organization's policies when using AI features.": "Anda bertanggung jawab untuk memantau penggunaan, mengelola biaya, dan memastikan kepatuhan terhadap kebijakan organisasi Anda saat menggunakan fitur AI.",
  "Important Reminder": "Pengingat Penting",
  "Always verify AI-generated suggestions before applying them to your Kubernetes clusters, especially in production environments. The AI Assistant is a tool to help you, but you remain responsible for all actions taken.": "Selalu verifikasi saran yang dihasilkan AI sebelum menerapkannya ke kluster Kubernetes Anda, terutama di lingkungan produksi. Asisten AI adalah alat bantu, namun Anda tetap bertanggung jawab atas semua tindakan yang diambil.",
  "I understand and accept these terms.": "Saya memahami dan menyetujui ketentuan ini.",
